# The mesas over the shoulder: their most characteristic ground at noon and in
# the golden hour, with the frame cost standing at noon.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_mesas.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_mesas
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:mesas
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end mesas-noon
hour 19
wait 2.0
shot golden with land:mesas
mouse 1400,0 1.0
wait 1.0
shot golden-turned with land:mesas
